You are asking an extremely broad question.

What compiler did you use on HP, what compiler are you using on
Tru64, is your code 'C' or 'C++', etc?

Your best bet is to read HP documentation, understand what flags
you are using there (and what for), then find equivalent flags
for Tru64.

Also note, that your software probably runs in 32-bit mode on HP,
and so you'll be porting to 64-bit platform. When such a
port is done for the first time, many issues often pop up.

If your software did not run on a 64-bit platform before, CCFLAGS
is likely to be the smallest of your problems ;-(

Cheers,


